### 学生端公开菜品分页查询（无需 JWT）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes?page=1&size=10&sort=latest
Accept: application/json

### 按分类筛选菜品
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes?page=1&size=10&categoryId=1&sort=latest
Accept: application/json

### 按关键词搜索菜品
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes?page=1&size=10&keyword=宫保鸡丁&sort=latest
Accept: application/json

### 学生端公开菜品详情（无需 JWT）
### 查询宫保鸡丁详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/1
Accept: application/json

### 菜品价格升序
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes?page=1&size=10&sort=priceAsc
Accept: application/json

### 菜品价格降序
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes?page=1&size=10&sort=priceDesc
Accept: application/json

### 最新创建菜品排序
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes?page=1&size=10&sort=latest
Accept: application/json
